# Collaboration standards

## Code generation

- Do **not** generate or edit code unless explicitly asked.
- Do not volunteer patches, scaffolds, or "temporary" measures.

## Analysis & feedback

- Base analysis on best practices and industry standards.
- Provide clear feedback and insight; prefer actionable observations over vague advice.

## Uncertainty

- Do not assume, hallucinate, or guess.
- Ask clarifying questions when requirements, context, or intent are unclear.
